---
// V18 卫所军事体系：375 点按建置年份「生长」，看军事网络如何铺满帝国
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="卫所军事体系（V18）· 地图" crumbs={[["/", "首页"], ["/maps", "地图"], ["", "卫所体系"]]}>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/vendor/leaflet.css" />
  <script is:inline src="/vendor/leaflet.js"></script>
  <div class="wrap" style="padding-top:20px">
    <div class="page-head" style="padding-top:0">
      <h1 style="margin:0">卫所军事体系（1364–1644）</h1>
      <p class="lede">拖动年份，看卫所从洪武初年的点状布防长成覆盖帝国的网络——边地密、内地疏的「军事地理分层」一目了然。点圆点看卫名与建置年。</p>
    </div>
    <div style="position:relative;height:640px;border-radius:var(--r-m);overflow:hidden;background:var(--c-paper);border:1px solid var(--c-line-soft)">
      <div id="v18map" style="position:absolute;inset:0"></div>
      <div style="position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:18px 16px 12px;background:linear-gradient(transparent,var(--c-surface-2) 45%)">
        <strong id="v18y" style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:20px;min-width:64px">1381</strong>
        <input id="v18slider" type="range" min="1364" max="1644" value="1381" style="flex:1;accent-color:var(--c-primary);height:44px;cursor:pointer" aria-label="建置年份滑杆" />
        <span id="v18c" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--c-ink-2)"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;font-size:12px;color:var(--c-ink-2);margin-top:8px;align-items:center">
      <span>边地卫（北纬 34° 以北）<span style="display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#B5382F;vertical-align:-1px"></span></span>
      <span>内地卫<span style="display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#C6A664;vertical-align:-1px"></span></span>
      <span>· 数据：CHGIS Ming Garrisons（DOI:10.7910/DVN/5RUXK8，仅「卫」级 375 点）·「五级卫所体系（卫-千户所）」中千户所未收，见 README_MingGarrisons</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const L = window.L;
  const dark = document.documentElement.dataset.theme === "dark";
  const map = L.map("v18map", { preferCanvas: true, attributionControl: false }).setView([33.5, 112], 4);
  L.tileLayer("https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png", { maxZoom: 12, crossOrigin: true }).addTo(map);

  const layer = L.layerGroup().addTo(map);
  let ALL = [];
  fetch("/geojson/ming_garrisons.json").then((r) => r.json()).then((d) => { ALL = d.features; apply(1381); });

  function apply(y) {
    layer.clearLayers();
    const shown = ALL.filter((f) => {
      const b = +f.properties.beg_yr || 1644;
      return b <= y;
    });
    shown.forEach((f) => {
      const [x, lat] = f.geometry.coordinates;
      const border = lat >= 34;
      L.circleMarker([lat, x], {
        radius: border ? 4 : 3.2, weight: 0.5,
        color: border ? "#7A1F1F" : "#6E5A2E",
        fillColor: border ? "#B5382F" : "#C6A664", fillOpacity: 0.85,
      })
        .bindTooltip(`<b>${f.properties.name_ch}</b><br/><span style="color:#8a8578">建置 ${f.properties.beg_yr ?? "?"} 年</span>`)
        .addTo(layer);
    });
    document.getElementById("v18y").textContent = y;
    document.getElementById("v18c").innerHTML = `已建置 <b style="color:var(--c-primary);font-size:15px">${shown.length}</b> 卫`;
  }
  const slider = document.getElementById("v18slider");
  slider.addEventListener("input", (e) => apply(+e.target.value));
</script>
